agy-plugin-cc

This project is a derivative work ported from openai/codex-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

The original codex-plugin-cc integrates the OpenAI Codex CLI with Claude Code.
This port adapts that design to drive the Antigravity CLI (`agy`) instead.
The Codex-specific app-server JSON-RPC transport and shared broker process have
been removed and replaced with single-turn Antigravity CLI subprocess
invocations.

The local grok-plugin-cc port was also used as the immediate structural
template for this Antigravity port.

Portions of the following files are copied or adapted from the original
project and remain under the Apache-2.0 license:

  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/args.mjs
  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/process.mjs
  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/fs.mjs
  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/git.mjs
  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/workspace.mjs
  - plugins/agy/scripts/lib/prompts.mjs
  - plugins/agy/schemas/review-output.schema.json
  - plugins/agy/prompts/review.md (adapted from prompts/adversarial-review.md)

